<title>UK: Amey shares rise on tram contract.</title>
<headline>Amey shares rise on tram contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Britain's Amey Plc rose on Monday after the construction company said it had won a 175 million stg contract to build a 28 km tram link through south London.</p>
<p>The stock was up 16-1/2p at 372 by 1213 GMT, some 10p higher than before the contract was announced.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 5106</p>
